<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Plaza Model role catalog seed data (PRD US-2.1 / BRD FR-2.1).

    noupdate="1": the organisation is expected to tune this catalog after
    install. Module upgrades must not silently overwrite local role
    definitions and thereby change who can do what.

    The backing res.groups records deliberately carry NO category_id.
    Odoo renders same-category groups as a single-choice selection on the
    user form; the Plaza Model requires users to be able to hold several
    roles at once (which is precisely why the SoD checker exists), so the
    groups are left uncategorised and render as independent checkboxes.
-->
<odoo noupdate="1">

