        <field name="comment">Ultimate accountable person and holder of the Nuclear Key. Provides the third and final approval on every override of a frozen record. Holds broad read visibility across Sales, Purchase and Accounting but originates no transactions, so that final approval is never given over the holder's own work.</field>
